---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 px-6 md:px-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans text-text-secondary">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif text-text-primary mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>Last updated: May 3, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect the email address you provide when joining our waitlist. This information is used exclusively to notify you about Maestro's launch and updates.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your email address will not be sold, rented, or shared with any third parties. We use industry-standard security measures via Supabase to ensure your data remains protected.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">3. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
      <p>We will retain your email address until you unsubscribe or request deletion. You can contact us at any time to have your information permanently removed from our systems.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">4. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>

      <p class="mt-12 text-sm">If you have any questions, please reach out to us at privacy@maestro.com.</p>
      
      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-primary hover:text-accent-glow no-underline">&larr; Back to home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
